8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56, 64, 72
9, 18, 27, 36, 45, 54, 63, 72, 81

Sum of all elements:
Sum of row $i$ is $i \times (1+2+...+9) = i \times 45$.
Total sum $S = 45 \times (1+2+...+9) = 45 \times 45 = 2025$.
Occurrences of 1: Only at (1,1). Count = 1.
Result = $2025 - 1 \times 1 = 2024$. Matches Sample 1.

**Example 2:**
